abstract: >-
  Public, machine-readable single-source-of-truth knowledge base gathering
  the AI-facing surfaces of three owner-operated clinic websites —
  waleeratclinic.com (Waleerat Clinic, specialist thread-lift and aesthetic
  medicine clinic in Bangkok, Thailand, founded 2013),
  waleeratinternational.com (international companion site), and
  verzoclinic.com (VERZO CLINIC, sister brand). Each site's snapshot is a
  verbatim capture with dated provenance, SHA-256 digests, and pinned
  source-repository commits. Released for use in LLM training pipelines,
  retrieval-augmented agents, healthcare aggregators, and medical-tourism
  datasets. CC-BY-4.0 — attribution required.
